From dfe2122273646d313ffa1e7f3a0125e25e4574f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Jelen <jjelen@redhat.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:00:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Update the upstream signing key

Rebuild libguestfs.keyring from the key upstream publishes at
https://download.libguestfs.org/rich@annexia.org-pubkey.txt, merged into
the existing keyring (same certificate(s)).
The commands are in the comment above its Source line.

The current key is needed to verify the release signature with
openpgpverify (sqv), which checks that the key was valid when the
release was signed.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
---
 libguestfs.keyring | Bin 82814 -> 83033 bytes
 libnbd.spec        |   5 +++++
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+)

